# Pinned sources of the Vexa Transcoder. This is the only file to edit when updating.
#
# The base is the official FFmpeg release. On top of it go the patch series maintained by Jellyfin (only its
# debian/patches folder is downloaded) and then ours (patches/vexa). The libraries use the commits Jellyfin's builder
# pins for the same patch series (builder/scripts.d/*.sh at that tag), a combination that is tested together.
# To update: pick the FFmpeg release and the matching patch series tag, copy both commits here and the SCRIPT_COMMIT of
# each library, run ./build.sh and then the tests.
#
# Git sources are checked by commit id; tarballs by sha256.

